@page "/hanmadi"
@{
    Layout = null;
    ViewData["Title"] = "한마디";
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>한마디</title>
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    color: #0f172a;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .hero {
    padding: 56px 24px 36px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .hero-icon { font-size: 52px; display: block; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .hero-title {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: #4f46e5;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .hero-sub { font-size: 15px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.65; }

  .cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 8px 20px 48px;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 26px 22px;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    transition: border-color .2s, box-shadow .2s, transform .15s;
    position: relative;
  }
  .card:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .card-admin:hover  { border-color: #6366f1; }
  .card-player:hover { border-color: #22c55e; }

  .card-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .card-emoji {
    width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 24px; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .card-admin  .card-emoji { background: #ede9fe; }
  .card-player .card-emoji { background: #dcfce7; }
  .card-name { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 900; color: #0f172a; }
  .card-admin  .card-name { color: #4f46e5; }
  .card-player .card-name { color: #16a34a; }
  .card-role { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-top: 2px; }

  .card-desc { font-size: 14px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 16px; }

  .steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .step { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; }
  .step-dot {
    width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .card-admin  .step-dot { background: #ede9fe; color: #6366f1; }
  .card-player .step-dot { background: #dcfce7; color: #16a34a; }

  .card-arrow {
    position: absolute; bottom: 24px; right: 22px;
    font-size: 16px; color: #cbd5e1;
    transition: color .2s, transform .2s;
  }
  .card:hover .card-arrow { color: #94a3b8; transform: translateX(3px); }

  .back-btn {
    display: block; text-align: center; color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; padding-bottom: 32px; margin-top: auto;
  }
  .back-btn:hover { color: #6366f1; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="hero">
  <span class="hero-icon">📡</span>
  <div class="hero-title">실시간 참여형 예배</div>
  <p class="hero-sub">코드 하나로 모두가 함께<br/>말씀에 반응하고, 질문에 답하고, 마음을 나눠요</p>
</div>

<div class="cards">
  <a href="/hanmadi/admin" class="card card-admin">
    <div class="card-head">
      <div class="card-emoji">🛠️</div>
      <div>
        <div class="card-name">출제자 입장</div>
        <div class="card-role">선생님 · 진행자</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="card-desc">세션을 만들고 문항을 출제해요.<br/>참여자 답변을 실시간으로 확인할 수 있어요.</p>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><span class="step-dot">1</span>세션 만들기 &amp; 문항 추가</div>
      <div class="step"><span class="step-dot">2</span>3자리 코드를 성도들에게 공유</div>
      <div class="step"><span class="step-dot">3</span>라이브 화면에서 출제·마감</div>
    </div>
    <span class="card-arrow">→</span>
  </a>

  <a href="/hanmadi/join" class="card card-player">
    <div class="card-head">
      <div class="card-emoji">✋</div>
      <div>
        <div class="card-name">참여자 입장</div>
        <div class="card-role">학생 · 청중</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="card-desc">선생님께 받은 3자리 코드를 입력하면<br/>바로 참여할 수 있어요. 로그인 불필요!</p>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><span class="step-dot">1</span>3자리 참여 코드 입력</div>
      <div class="step"><span class="step-dot">2</span>닉네임 입력 (선택)</div>
      <div class="step"><span class="step-dot">3</span>문항이 뜨면 바로 답변</div>
    </div>
    <span class="card-arrow">→</span>
  </a>
</div>

<a href="/" class="back-btn">← 홈으로 돌아가기</a>

</body>
</html>
